      "text": "6. In the event that a Grievance Procedure either personally or through an appropriate representative or an organization of which he or she is a member, provided, that where an employee organization has been certified as the exclusive bargaining agent for the employee unit, a grievance may be represented and processed either by such certified employee organization or by the individual employee, but not through any other employee organization.",
